Graft is an idiomatic Haskell port of the core ideas in Rowan, developed by
the rust-analyzer project: https://github.com/rust-analyzer/rowan

The initial implementation was written in Haskell after studying Rowan's
green trees, cursor editing, builders, cache, and tests at revision
b6f1cb6494a99a2264186d110b1b170989774814 (version 0.17.0 in Cargo.toml),
retrieved on 2026-10-10. Graft is not affiliated with the Rowan project.

